ENTITY is the offer or package name the field belongs to, or - for venue-level. VALUE per the section (1, 8, a band number, or verbatim for *_verbatim fields; omit 0 fields entirely). QUOTE is the deciding passage copied exactly from an excerpt line, or empty after the tab for value 8 explained in a trailing note line NOTE	<field>	<why>. For every monetary figure output also a line:
