1227:Binna Burra is an easily accessible venue, only 90 minutes from Brisbane or 1 hour from the Gold Coast, with great road access (for buses too) and ample parking. It features a range of accommodation from the luxurious Sky Lodge Apartments to our rainforest Safari tents. Staying at Binna Burra Lodge is a wilderness experience that inspires team bonding and confidence to achieve your business goals.
